52
00:02:58,144 --> 00:02:59,066
Peppa，George

53
00:02:59,106 --> 00:03:00,749
嚟啦，Peppa、George

54
00:03:00,789 --> 00:03:02,270
我哋跳舞吖

55
00:03:08,882 --> 00:03:11,685
